# Ruling 2025-07-25: "Any enters abilities of the copied permanent will trigger when the tokens enter." Onslaught for X=2
# copies Bot1's Baleful Strix: two tokens enter together, each draws a card as its own enters trigger resolves. Bot1 draws
# one (the Strix's own enters, turn 1), one for the turn-3 draw step and two for the tokens: four Islands, Onslaught having been cast
# so the hand holds exactly those four. The tokens are sacrificed at the end step (artifact creatures with no cards to
# leave behind): the Strix alone remains, Onslaught in the graveyard.

